# Whole-line comments only: systemd's EnvironmentFile keeps everything after `=` as the
# value, an inline comment included, and the guest then fails with "builder error".
# With egress gateways (ADR-0027 decision 3): a gateway's sandbox address and the control
# relay's broker port, by address, since the segment has no resolver; the pool's bootstrap
# list of gateways is /etc/mediatore/gateways (MEDIATORE_GATEWAYS_FILE to read another).
MEDIATORE_URL=https://mediatore.sandbox.example:8443
SPIFFE_ENDPOINT_SOCKET=/run/spire/sockets/agent.sock
RUST_LOG=info
# The per-claim sandbox tmpfs (ADR-0021): the kernel's size syntax; 50% of RAM when unset.
# MEDIATORE_SANDBOX_SIZE=4g
# Registries reached over plain HTTP, comma-separated; pin their images by digest.
# MEDIATORE_PLAIN_HTTP_REGISTRIES=registry.internal:5000
